{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-my-first-baby-spinner-sold-by-the-works-2609-0229","content_id":"3deedfd3-67dd-4081-86c6-befe19b89197","description":"Product Recall for My First Baby Spinner presenting a risk of choking. ","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"7f3b22c6-7aa6-4213-8ffb-e7942b0c00a4","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-10-02T14:23:14+01:00","id":"7f3b22c6-7aa6-4213-8ffb-e7942b0c00a4","title":"Link to Product Image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-10-02T14:23:14+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6abfb042241ecad55a9792fd/2609-0229-product-recall-baby-spinner.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: My First Baby Spinner sold by The Works</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a risk of choking as it has small parts that can detach or break off during reasonably foreseeable use.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The product has been recalled from end users by The Works.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Toys - Baby/Infant Stimulation Toys (Non Powered)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Playworks</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Batches</td>\n      <td>186334, 184455, 181089, 181088, 181087, 181086, 180872, 180873, 174513 (All batches)</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Barcode</td>\n      <td>5052089365995</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Spinning toy with suction-cup base, intended for babies/toddlers. Colours may vary.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_7f3b22c6-7aa6-4213-8ffb-e7942b0c00a4\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6abfb042241ecad55a9792fd/2609-0229-product-recall-baby-spinner.pdf\">Link to Product Image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a risk of choking as it has small parts that can detach or break off during reasonably foreseeable use. These small parts pose a choking risk to young children, particularly those under 36 months of age who have a natural tendency to explore objects by placing them in their mouths.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the Toys (Safety) Regulations 2011.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The product has been recalled from end users by The Works. We recommend owners stop using this product immediately and keep it out of the reach of babies and children.</p>\n\n<p>For more information, please access: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.theworks.co.uk/page/product-recalls.html?srsltid=AU7gw4Wt2Kq02DjKxjNggyznASPGC7-zPFPMgIvKCli1A9AzKBmuDPTF\">Product Recalls at The Works</a> or contact The Works via <a href=\"mailto:enquiries@theworks.co.uk\">enquiries@theworks.co.uk</a> / 0121 313 6050.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2609-0229</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-10-02T13:24:25Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"toys","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-10-02","product_risk_level":"medium"},"temporary_update_t